And a few extra hands to keep them all on.  Try to get telecontrol and
teleport as intrinsics.  The risk is getting teleportitis before you
get control, so either have a ring of teleport control and eat all
leprechauns and tengus you can find, or tin them and then eat
20 in a row to maximize your chances of getting both.  (Leprechaun
halls are good for this.)  Polycontrol and polymorph aren't essential.
If you have them, keep them in your stash so you can make pets and
stone grenades when you want to, but there's no need to bring them
along.

