I am absolutely terrified with how it is, which is why any wands of
cancellation I find will be in a locked chest in my stash and nowhere
near my bag of holding.  Remove curse works fine, and keeping it in
an oilskin sack keeps it blessed no matter what Rodney does.

You can decide on the level of risk you're comfortable with, but my
philosophy is maximizing my chance of ascension by minimizing the
chance of something going horribly horribly wrong.  I'm careful but
I still make mistakes. I want to make sure I can recover from them.

